silver-potato -- useful outputs from brainfuck code
===================================================

silver-potato provides useful outputs with a bunch of brainfuck code:
the emoji/ directory holds programs that print text emoticons (a cat,
a cow, a penguin and more), and bf_preparator.sh strips everything but
brainfuck commands from a file.

